OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 17 MAR
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Donizetti
OL,5,     GDonald Macleod follows the
OL,6,     Girresistible rise of Italian
OL,7,     Gopera composer Gaetano Donizetti.
OL,8,     GToday, Donizetti battles
OL,9,     G"pirates", writes about love
OL,10,     Gpotions, and falls in love
OL,11,     Ghimself.
OL,12,G1700FIn Tune
OL,13,     GKatie Derham is joined live in
OL,14,     Gstudio by Gerard Flotats ahead of
OL,15,     Ghis concert at the Barnes Music
OL,16,     GFestival. Also, Greg James chats
OL,17,     Gto Katie about Radio 1's Longest
OL,18,     GRide.
OL,19,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,20,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,21,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
