OL,4,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,5,     GConductor Nil Venditti joins
OL,6,     GRoyal Northern Sinfonia and
OL,7,     Gviolinist Maria Wloszczowska at
OL,8,     Gthe Glasshouse in Gateshead to
OL,9,     Gperform music by Anna Clyne,
OL,10,     GProkofiev and Mendelssohn.
OL,11,G2145FThe Essay: Scotland Rocks
OL,12,     GKenneth Steven combines Scottish
OL,13,     Glandscape and geological history
OL,14,     Gwith poetry. Scotland has some of
OL,15,     Gthe most exciting gemstones, but
OL,16,     Gknowing where to find them is the
OL,17,     Gsecret.
