OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 17 MAR
OL,4,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,5,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,6,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,7,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,8,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,9,     Geverything in between.
OL,10,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,11,     GSoweto welcomes back his guest
OL,12,     Gthis week, Naissam Jalal, who has
OL,13,     Ganother jazz album to share
OL,14,     Gtonight.
OL,15,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,16,     GPablo Ferrandez performs
OL,17,     GSchumann's Cello Concerto with
OL,18,     Gthe WDR Symphony Orchestra,
OL,19,     GCologne. Tchaikovsky's Fifth
OL,20,     GSymphony and Beethoven's 'Egmont'
